      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.04,
      "end_seconds": 35.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.53,
      "end_seconds": 67.07,
      "duration_seconds": 14.54,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 86 beats a minute, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temp 36.9 degrees. And BP is 112 over 71, respiratory rate 16. Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.69,
      "end_seconds": 81.34,
      "duration_seconds": 13.65,
      "text": "It's been six months now. Sorry, uh, I know I'm rambling a bit. Oh, and a low mood. That's been about the same, three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.42,
      "end_seconds": 86.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Okay, did you notice any bladder problems?"
